title: Moscow's Verdict
subtitle: The International decides who is to blame for the German October.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1924 and rf_over = 0
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.line = 'bolshevization';
Q.verdict_seen = 1;
var blamed = Q.october_leader || Q.leader;
Q.blamed = blamed;
Q.blamed_name = window.RF.names[blamed];
var hit = Q.october_outcome == 'crushed' ? 35 : 25;
var loss = Q.october_outcome == 'crushed' ? 20 : 15;
Q[blamed + '_moscow'] -= hit;
var target = blamed == 'left' ? 'center' : 'left';
window.RF.shift(Q, blamed, target, loss);
Q.player_blamed = Q.player == blamed ? 1 : 0;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

= Moscow's Verdict

In January 1924 the Presidium of the International meets on the German question. Zinoviev needs the October defeat to be someone else's fault: his own rivals in Moscow are already using it against him. The verdict is that the German revolution was lost by the opportunism of the party leadership.

The blame falls on the [+ blamed_name +]. [? if october_outcome == "crushed" : The rising was crushed, and the punishment is harsh. ?][? if october_outcome == "retreat" : The retreat at Chemnitz is called a capitulation without a fight. ?]

The Comintern's line turns left. The new watchword is "Bolshevization": the national parties are to be rebuilt on the Russian model, under Moscow's discipline.

[? if player_blamed : You are the scapegoat. ?][? if player_blamed = 0 : The scapegoat is someone else. The question is what you do with that. ?]

- @submit: Submit, and publish a self-criticism.
- @appeal: Appeal to the ECCI: the plan was Moscow's, not yours.
- @defy: Refuse the verdict.
- @attack: Join the attack on the old leadership.
- @defend: Defend the old leadership in the name of unity.
- @quiet: Say nothing, and see who comes out on top.

@submit
view-if: player_blamed = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 10;
Q[Q.player + '_dissent'] -= 10;
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] -= 4;
!}
go-to: caretaker

@appeal
view-if: player_blamed = 1
choose-if: funds >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A delegation to Moscow needs money the party does not have (2 funds).
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 2;
Q.appeal_worked = Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] >= 35 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.appeal_worked) {
    Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 6;
    Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 5;
} else {
    Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] -= 5;
}
!}
go-to: appeal_result

@appeal_result
go-to: caretaker

[? if appeal_worked : Your friends in Moscow soften the resolution. You are criticised, not destroyed. ?][? if appeal_worked = 0 : The ECCI hears your delegation and confirms the verdict. Arguing has made it worse. ?]

@defy
view-if: player_blamed = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] -= 30;
Q[Q.player + '_dissent'] += 30;
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 3;
Q.autonomy -= 5;
!}
go-to: caretaker

@attack
view-if: player_blamed = 0
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.shift(Q, Q.blamed, Q.player, 8);
Q[Q.blamed + '_dissent'] += 15;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 5;
!}
go-to: caretaker

@defend
view-if: player_blamed = 0
on-arrival: {!
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { Q[f + '_dissent'] -= 6; }
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] -= 6;
Q[Q.blamed + '_moscow'] += 5;
!}
go-to: caretaker

@quiet
view-if: player_blamed = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 2;
!}
go-to: caretaker

@caretaker
on-arrival: {!
var RF = window.RF;
RF.normalize(Q);
// Moscow names a caretaker leadership; the Middle Group is the safe choice
var best = null, bestScore = -1;
for (var f of RF.factions) {
    if (f == Q.blamed || Q[f + '_expelled']) { continue; }
    var score = RF.moscowScore(Q, f) + (f == 'center' ? 10 : 0);
    if (score > bestScore) { bestScore = score; best = f; }
}
Q.leader = best;
Q.autonomy -= 8;
RF.normalize(Q);
!}

= A new Zentrale

Moscow does not wait for a congress. The ECCI names a new leadership: the [+ leader_name +]. A congress will meet in the spring to confirm it, or not.

[? if player_leads : The Zentrale is yours. Hold it until Frankfurt. ?][? if player_leads = 0 : You are not in charge. The congress is your chance. ?]
